<description>&lt;p&gt;Thailand deployed two F-16 jets to Mae Hong Son and another pair to the Myanmar border in response to Myanmar air force activity, while also offering to send scientists to Myanmar to address toxic pollution in border rivers. Cambodia urged Thailand to respect its sovereignty and border agreements, and Thailand rejected Cambodian wording on displaced people at an ASEAN meeting. Trade negotiations between Trump and Thailand remain unresolved, and Indonesia, the Philippines and Thailand are exploring cross-border oil access to strengthen energy security. The UCDP recorded 35 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/live/2026/11/17/world/trump-asean-summit/trumps-trade-deal-with-thailand-is-not-a-done-deal&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMid0FVX3lxTE1uZjlwRVpXd3l1RWpIb3B4OG5zN2tQSkFKaG9HY2tLLTVLelItQ09pVE1VcTFEaWwwUUx3WnBsZmNobncwS0toOF8zM2lBWS1OZ2Ezb3BJSVJhY2dLSDZ3a3pKLUFFOWVsUXdyUWlJQVB1Yno1djc0?oc=5&quot;&gt;Thaiger&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiUkFVX3lxTE54T016eFhYejB4dHdBUTlaeklSRGFrbXg2aTBZbUozZU45WnhadThwWTZGRHduQUFJbGhkSk00QlBiRGJxdW5aamUtLVpLdmNHX3c?oc=5&quot;&gt;Iran International&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;cbs19.tv&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipAFBVV95cUxPVm52MzNjX3J1QkJmeDdIeEllUmdENnRHUXFndHpEN0R0M0lBTV8yWHBhOS1EUk5YVF9MRmRoTU91cmhSYTVGVU90MnVMcndTb1Jpdm1EdG5PYldzM0ExdGdXcE8yQTVGakZHLWZFQ3p4WVZmbDdfX1NBNWFfcno2bG1pbTBJbklCeXlpdWdRSEZoc1NXYlVDbUl1NXBtUjF2U3dKbw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Khmer Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwAFBVV95cUxNS25kTDZDWTU0UFFoVmJqakJkazVpYmVHNHJ1